    "CoiStatement": "Disclosure Dr Cies is a consultant for Atlantic Diagnostic Laboratories and has received grants or honoraria from Allergan, Merck, and Thermo Fisher Scientific. Drs Moore and Chopra declare no conflicts or financial interests, and neither does Ms Enache. The authors had full access to all of the data in the study and take responsibility for the integrity of the data and the accuracy of the data analysis.",
    "Article": {
      "Pagination": {"MedlinePgn": "276-285"},
